---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok 4 Day Tour – Grand Jungle"
  description="A fabulous khao Sok 4 day tour. 2 nights at Riverside Cottages, and 1 night at the lake. Connect with nature on this khao Sok jungle tour."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/GrandAdventure_Package_Tours_Lake_MG_7674.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok 4 Day Tour – Grand Jungle"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "4 Day Khao Sok Jungle Tour L...", "href": "/4-day-khao-sok-jungle-tour-lake-overnight/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok 4 Day Tour</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Package with 1 night at Riverside Cottages, 1 night at Floating Bungalows, and 1 more night at Riverside Cottages. Dive deeper on this Khao Sok 4 day tour.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Day 1: Arrive at Riverside Cottages for check in and be shown to your room. In the afternoon, explore the river by <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">canoeing</a> or hop on top of a rubber ring and go <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">river tubing</a>. At the end of the day, continue the Khao Sok Jungle Tour with a <a href="/khao-sok-night-safari/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">night safari </a>to look for nocturnal wildlife or skip the night hike and get a relaxing one hour Thai massage.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Day 2: Continue the adventure with an overnight trip to <a href="/cheow-lan-lake-information-guide/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn</a> Lake. Join with a guide and a group of 10-18 other guests, take a boat ride through incredible scenery to a raft house where you will have lunch. In the afternoon, go for a hike in the jungle, or just relax and swim in the emerald waters.<br /> After a fresh dinner (included), spend the night in a floating bamboo bungalow. Please note that the floating bungalows at the lake are very rustic, and there is a shared bathroom (private bathrooms are not available).
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Day 3: Wake up early for a morning mist safari, and look for giant hornbills, monkeys, and gibbons feeding in the trees before breakfast. Check out of your room and enjoy the boat ride back to the pier. Back to Riverside Cottages by 12pm, for a lunch of fried rice and a relaxing afternoon. Overnight at Riverside Cottages.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Day 4: End your Khao Sok jungle tour with a half-day hike in Khao Sok National park or take a short drive to a scenic viewpoint and the warm waters of the hot springs. Program finishes with checkout at noon.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Price per person: ฿6,900 to ฿7,300 depending on the season</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Price does not include entrance fee to Khao Sok National Park.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Includes all meals on Day 2, breakfast and lunch on Day 3, and breakfast on Day 4.</span>
          </li>
